WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.080
An equation is a balance.

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.220
Two x plus three equals eleven.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.050
Take three from both sides:

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.460
two x equals eight.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.760
Halve both sides:

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.990
x equals four.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:20.200
Check: two fours plus three is eleven. Balanced.

